# Response headers for every page and file, applied by Cloudflare's static
# asset hosting (vite copies this file from static/ into dist/).
#
# - nosniff: a file is only ever run as the type it was served as.
# - frame-ancestors / X-Frame-Options: no other site can load this one in a
#   frame, which is what clickjacking needs.
# - object-src / base-uri: no plugins, and injected markup cannot re-point
#   relative URLs at another host.
# - Permissions-Policy: the microphone stays available to this site for voice
#   notes; camera, location, payment and USB are off for it and for every
#   embed (the Google Maps frames need none of them).
# - COOP same-origin-allow-popups: pages this site opens cannot reach back into
#   it, while a sign-in popup still works.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; upgrade-insecure-requests
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(self), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin-allow-popups
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
